---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How River Heights Montessori collects, uses and protects the personal information families share with us.">
  <section class="wrap pband" style="padding-bottom:64px">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;max-width:860px">
      <p class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Privacy Policy</span></p>
      <h1 class="h1p">Privacy <span class="ac">policy.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: [DATE]</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <!-- DRAFT: have this reviewed by the owner (and ideally a lawyer) before launch. -->
      <p>River Heights Montessori ("we") respects the privacy of the families who contact us. This policy explains what personal information we collect through this website, why we collect it, and how we protect it.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit our Book a Tour form, we collect the information you choose to give us, which may include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>your child's first name, date of birth or due date, and current care arrangement;</li>
        <li>your name, email address, phone number, home address and postal code;</li>
        <li>employer and occupation for you and, if provided, a second parent or guardian;</li>
        <li>your preferred program, schedule, start date and tour time, and any notes you add.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use this information only to respond to your inquiry, arrange a tour, assess availability, manage our wait list and, if you enrol, begin registration. We do not sell or rent your information.</p>
      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>Your form is delivered to us by email through our email service provider. We do not share your information with anyone else unless the law requires it.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep inquiry information for as long as needed to respond to you and manage our wait list, and delete it when it is no longer needed. [Confirm retention period.]</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You may ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or withdraw your consent to be contacted, at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:info@riverheightschildcare.com">info@riverheightschildcare.com</a> or calling <a href="tel:+12043068778">(204) 306-8778</a>.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>River Heights Montessori, 333 Wilton Street, Winnipeg, MB R3M 3B7. [Name of the person responsible for privacy.]</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
